        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Considering the above, this Court finds that the trademark \"ANIK\" and the trade dress of the plaintiff are inherently a distinctive one and the customer will assume that spurious inferior quality of product bearing the identical and decepti"
