          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nIn view of the above, this Court finds that the plaintiff has made out a prima facie case and the balance of convenience and inconvenience in favour of the plaintiff."
